on the communication,

00:26:22.948 --> 00:26:25.928
not necessarily your abilities.

00:26:25.928 --> 00:26:29.469
And if you love Science,
want to share Science.

00:26:29.469 --> 00:26:31.636
Then nothing can stop you.

00:26:32.708 --> 00:26:34.268
- No well, that resonates a lot with me

00:26:34.268 --> 00:26:35.468
because both of your videos

00:26:35.468 --> 00:26:38.248
