So you get...

00:26:39.081 --> 00:26:41.750
(laughing)

00:26:41.750 --> 00:26:45.274
- I'm definitely on the lower
production end of things.

00:26:45.274 --> 00:26:47.281
But you know, this is a real treat.

00:26:47.281 --> 00:26:49.163
I look forward to seeing you both.

00:26:49.163 --> 00:26:50.728
I hope everyone watching,

